  "intro": {
    "lesson_focus": "Count occurrences with 次 (cì), identify particular occasions, and express repetition with 再 (zài).",
    "core_principle": "Distinguish the character 次 (cì), the counting phrase 一次 (yí cì), temporal expressions such as 上一次 (shàng yí cì), and adverbial repetition such as 再一次 (zài yí cì).",
    "learning_priority": "Learn the six main expressions, practice natural sentences, then explore conversational shortenings, frequency complements, and tone sandhi."
  },
  "sections": {
    "overview": {
      "core_takeaway": "次 (cì) counts occurrences of actions; 一次 (yí cì) can count one occurrence, while 上一次 (shàng yí cì), 这一次 (zhè yí cì), and 下一次 (xià yí cì) identify particular occasions.",
      "independent_usage": "Common as a measure word after a numeral and in occurrence-related phrases; not typically used alone to say “once.”",
      "modern_roles": [
        "Verbal measure word / frequency complement",
        "Component of temporal noun phrases",
        "Component of quantified every-time expressions",
        "Component of repetition adverbials"
      ],
      "teaching_priority": "High for this beginner lesson.",
      "meaning_map": [
        {
          "id": "meaning-occurrences",
          "reading": "cì",
          "function_en": "Count occurrences of an action",
          "register": "everyday",
          "example": {
            "hanzi": "去一次",
            "pinyin": "qù yí cì",
            "meaning_en": "go once"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "meaning-occasion",
          "reading": "cì",
          "function_en": "Refer to a particular occasion",
          "register": "everyday",
          "example": {
            "hanzi": "上一次",
            "pinyin": "shàng yí cì",
            "meaning_en": "last time"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "meaning-repetition",
          "reading": "cì",
          "function_en": "Contribute an occurrence count inside a repetition phrase",
          "register": "everyday to slightly emphatic",
          "example": {
            "hanzi": "再一次",
            "pinyin": "zài yí cì",
            "meaning_en": "once again"
          }
        }
      ],
      "one_minute_explanation": "After a verb, 一次 (yí cì) answers “how many times?” In expressions like 上一次 (shàng yí cì), 这一次 (zhè yí cì), or 下一次 (xià yí cì), it answers “which occasion?” 再一次 (zài yí cì) generally means “once again.” In all these expressions, 一 (yī) is pronounced yí before the fourth-tone word 次 (cì)."
    },
