          "correction": "Use 再试一次 (zài shì yí cì) for “try again” and 我在学习 (Wǒ zài xuéxí) for “I am studying”.",
          "reason": "They are homophones with different grammatical functions."
        },
        {
          "id": "m-shorter",
          "incorrect_inference": "Assume 上一次 (shàng yí cì) is incorrect because speakers often say 上次 (shàng cì).",
          "correction": "Both are correct; the shorter alternative is especially common in conversation.",
          "reason": "The longer variant can emphasize one particular occasion."
        },
        {
          "id": "m-every-dou",
          "incorrect_inference": "Treat 都 (dōu) as mandatory after every use of 每一次 (měi yí cì).",
          "correction": "Learn 每……都…… (měi ... dōu ...) as a highly conventional pattern, not an absolute requirement.",
          "reason": "Other syntactic configurations are also possible."
        },
        {
          "id": "m-related",
          "incorrect_inference": "Describe 再来一次 (zài lái yí cì) as a shortened form of 再一次 (zài yí cì).",
          "correction": "Teach it as a related verb phrase with 来 (lái), not a shortening.",
          "reason": "The form and syntactic structure are different."
        }
      ]
